    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Curyeux</strong> is a dreamlike <strong>puzzle-platformer</strong> where <strong>Lucienne Gr\u00e9goire</strong>, the protagonist, embarks on a <strong>personal quest</strong> for meaning. Journey through fragmented memories drawn from her artistic world, as she dives deep into a period of intense introspection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/a48157c7b781d01dbd1e7886d24fdeda.avif?t=1754665937\" width=616 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a piece of memory, where logic gives way to perception. You\u2019ll need to run, jump, solve, circumvent, and understand in order to move forward\u2026 and uncover yourself along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/e4b6cf3992ee6a6610c87c61185b1796.poster.avif?t=1754665937\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/e4b6cf3992ee6a6610c87c61185b1796.webm?t=1754665937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/e4b6cf3992ee6a6610c87c61185b1796.mp4?t=1754665937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure leads you through ever-changing painterly <strong>environments</strong>\u00a0: sketches, watercolors, bursts of color and brushstrokes, where appearances are often <strong>deceiving</strong>. Lucienne must learn to see through her own illusions, accept who she is, and break <strong>free</strong> from the gaze of others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/f7e60fda4127a149f96398e5a7023e68.poster.avif?t=1754665937\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/f7e60fda4127a149f96398e5a7023e68.webm?t=1754665937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/f7e60fda4127a149f96398e5a7023e68.mp4?t=1754665937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 A variety of <strong>painterly landscapes</strong>, where every shape reflects an emotional state.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Puzzles</strong> that <strong>challenge</strong> your reasoning and perception : observe, understand, and experiment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c A <strong>symbolic</strong> and <strong>touching narrative</strong>, told through the environment, movement, sound, and gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/5c6a55a0b615a6ad73e4e61a24347aa5.poster.avif?t=1754665937\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/5c6a55a0b615a6ad73e4e61a24347aa5.webm?t=1754665937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/5c6a55a0b615a6ad73e4e61a24347aa5.mp4?t=1754665937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>introspective</strong> journey about <strong>identity</strong>, self-acceptance, and the transformative power of <strong>doubt</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Curyeux</strong> is a dreamlike <strong>puzzle-platformer</strong> where <strong>Lucienne Gr\u00e9goire</strong>, the protagonist, embarks on a <strong>personal quest</strong> for meaning. Journey through fragmented memories drawn from her artistic world, as she dives deep into a period of intense introspection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/a48157c7b781d01dbd1e7886d24fdeda.avif?t=1754665937\" width=616 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a piece of memory, where logic gives way to perception. You\u2019ll need to run, jump, solve, circumvent, and understand in order to move forward\u2026 and uncover yourself along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/e4b6cf3992ee6a6610c87c61185b1796.poster.avif?t=1754665937\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/e4b6cf3992ee6a6610c87c61185b1796.webm?t=1754665937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/e4b6cf3992ee6a6610c87c61185b1796.mp4?t=1754665937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure leads you through ever-changing painterly <strong>environments</strong>\u00a0: sketches, watercolors, bursts of color and brushstrokes, where appearances are often <strong>deceiving</strong>. Lucienne must learn to see through her own illusions, accept who she is, and break <strong>free</strong> from the gaze of others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/f7e60fda4127a149f96398e5a7023e68.poster.avif?t=1754665937\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/f7e60fda4127a149f96398e5a7023e68.webm?t=1754665937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/f7e60fda4127a149f96398e5a7023e68.mp4?t=1754665937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 A variety of <strong>painterly landscapes</strong>, where every shape reflects an emotional state.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Puzzles</strong> that <strong>challenge</strong> your reasoning and perception : observe, understand, and experiment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c A <strong>symbolic</strong> and <strong>touching narrative</strong>, told through the environment, movement, sound, and gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/5c6a55a0b615a6ad73e4e61a24347aa5.poster.avif?t=1754665937\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/5c6a55a0b615a6ad73e4e61a24347aa5.webm?t=1754665937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/5c6a55a0b615a6ad73e4e61a24347aa5.mp4?t=1754665937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>introspective</strong> journey about <strong>identity</strong>, self-acceptance, and the transformative power of <strong>doubt</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Dive into the mind of Lucienne, a tormented painter. Leap through emotional memories, solve puzzles where shapes deceive and emotion leads the way. A dreamlike platformer where each painting brings you one step closer to yourself.",
    "supported_languages": "French<strong>*</strong>, English, Italian, German, Russian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Ukrainian, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
